    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absolutely the most energetic wife on the internet, dancing with you while gaming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join QQ group 1009657252 for more information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Manual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-9: Trigger various dance animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0: Reset character position and rotation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z: Rotate character left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: Rotate character right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M: Toggle movement to origin (0,0,0), character slowly moves back to original position while dancing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V: Toggle character animation and camera following mouse pointer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N: Toggle Root Motion switch, character will ignore dance movement, staying in place</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F: Cycle through expressions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >, (comma): Switch to next camera position</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B: Cycle through scene objects, these objects will react to sound rhythm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl+C: Toggle resolution maximization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F11: Cycle through resolutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More wives, more surprises!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absolutely the most energetic wife on the internet, dancing with you while gaming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join QQ group 1009657252 for more information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Manual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-9: Trigger various dance animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0: Reset character position and rotation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z: Rotate character left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: Rotate character right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M: Toggle movement to origin (0,0,0), character slowly moves back to original position while dancing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V: Toggle character animation and camera following mouse pointer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N: Toggle Root Motion switch, character will ignore dance movement, staying in place</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F: Cycle through expressions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >, (comma): Switch to next camera position</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B: Cycle through scene objects, these objects will react to sound rhythm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl+C: Toggle resolution maximization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F11: Cycle through resolutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More wives, more surprises!</p>",
